<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="justice-points">Justice Points for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h3>A key change is the appearance of tier pieces available to us for JP (Justice Points). While tier 11 set bonuses are not that impressive for pre-raid purposes, many of the individual pieces are still potent and hold up. While there are alternate gearing streams for certain slots in phase 3, we still recommend that most players utilize the updated JP vendors to gear as the new gearing sources have varying degrees of degeneracy involved; ranging from grinding raid mobs for reputation, to simply doing dailies.<br/>
<br/>All in all the 359 gear offered for JP is competitive for most users looking to gear out pre-raid and while the set bonuses are not that outstanding, the pieces themselves are substantial upgrades over their dungeon drop counterparts.<br/>
<br/>
