<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="fissure-stone-fragment">Fissure Stone Fragment for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h3>This is obtained from doing primarily pre-raid content, running Elemental Rune Dungeons. They're acquired relatively fast and you can expect between 1 and 2 items a day should you do all available dungeons.<br/>
<br/>While this is an ordered list, we recommend that you purchase based on what you currently have, buying to replace your lowest item level pieces first is generally a good idea. The actual numbering is not going to have a massive impact on your performance either way.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232947/satchel-of-the-cloudburst-cloak">
<img alt="Satchel of the Cloudburst Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Cloudburst Cloak</span></a> offers the potential for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69878/permafrost-cape">
<img alt="Permafrost Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrowncloak.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Permafrost Cape</span></a> of the Bedrock to be rolled, while it's a good item we don't think you should spend your early fragments on this in case the RNG is horrendeous.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59347/mace-of-acrid-death">
<img alt="Mace of Acrid Death" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_bwdraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace of Acrid Death</span></a> we rank this last even though it's not the worst pick up. It's just that there are many easy to obtain BoE weapons from previous phases that competes with this and depending on how you want to roll, you could get those over this. Also, weapon upgrades are essentially just DPS upgrades and offer you very little otherwise.<br/>
<br/>
