<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h3>The ability to acquire multiple Valor Point pieces in pre-raid is dubious, however should you ever come across any in reasonable amounts we will list the VP gear we think will benefit you the most from the outset and in the POV of pre-raid gearing as well as what will last you the longest in p3 raiding. We ask that you pay attention to the gear that you might have already acquired so that you maximize your upgrades here, if VP is limited in your chosen content.<br/>
<br/>
