<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Head for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>As an Engineer your first choice here should be the crafted goggles.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60356/reinforced-sapphirium-faceguard">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Faceguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Faceguard</span></a> is purchased for 32 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> and makes for a solid pick up for those that are not looking to craft goggles.<br/>
<br/>Otherwise your pre-raid options are mostly about trying to pick out the right stats for you, unfortunately there is no mastery+exp/<wbr/>hit, or mastery+avoidance in this slot forcing you to make a decision between mastery+dump stat or getting stats like parry/<wbr/>dodge that are a little more keyed for your tanking purposes than crit &amp; haste.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69558/spiritshield-mask">
<img alt="Spiritshield Mask" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_115.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spiritshield Mask</span></a> added in phase 2 isn't the best helmet, though if you do have this you can more or less forego other options on this list. At this stage pre-raid gearing is less about optimizing your set and more about getting you into raid to begin with.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Head Enchants</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62366/arcanum-of-the-earthen-ring">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Earthen Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Earthen Ring</span></a></div>
