<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Shoulders for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67144/pauldrons-of-edward-the-odd">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Edward the Odd" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Edward the Odd</span></a> sits competitive with other pre-raid choices. However being BoE and somewhat contested by other users looking to gear up, this may be prohibitively expensive. We have access to catch-up gear that lets you largely bypass these.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65027/pauldrons-of-the-apocalypse">
<img alt="Pauldrons of the Apocalypse" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of the Apocalypse</span></a> is purchased for 60 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> and while they don't have knock out the park fantastic stats, they're high item level and with it just a lot of raw value. Unless you want to acquire set bonuses, we think these should be your default go-to shoulders.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60358/reinforced-sapphirium-shoulderguards">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Shoulderguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Shoulderguards</span></a> can be purchased for 32 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> and do not quite hold up versus the better alternatives though depending on how you value the set bonus, these can be grabbed at some point.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69573/pauldrons-of-sacrifice">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Sacrifice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_84.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Sacrifice</span></a> drops from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=24239/hex-lord-malacrass">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Hex Lord Malacrass</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a> is a strong pre-raid contender for those that don't have the inclination to purchase their shoulders.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56452/earthshape-pauldrons">
<img alt="Earthshape Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthshape Pauldrons</span></a> drops from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=40319/drahga-shadowburner">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Drahga Shadowburner</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4926/blackrock-caverns">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackrock Caverns</span></a>, they're actually a solid pick up should you come across them. While we don't think you should be actively target farming any heroic dungeon gear this phase, you could sideline the shoulder acquisition until later if these drop.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Shoulder Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86402/inscription-of-the-earth-prince">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_mastersinscription.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription of the Earth Prince</span></a> &gt; <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62333/greater-inscription-of-unbreakable-quartz">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_crystal_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz</span></a></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
