<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Back for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>The game is fairly generous with pre-raid cloaks, though phase 3 offers us <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71270/mantle-of-patience">
<img alt="Mantle of Patience" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_firelands_fireset_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Patience</span></a>, obtainable from a quest related to the new storyline introduced with Firelands. <br/>
<br/>Otherwise this phase also permits us to acquire <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69878/permafrost-cape">
<img alt="Permafrost Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrowncloak.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Permafrost Cape</span></a> through purchasing <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232957/satchel-of-the-permafrost-cape">
<img alt="Satchel of the Permafrost Cape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Satchel of the Permafrost Cape</span></a>. *The price on these may be misleading as you can end up spending much more than the initial price of 12 Fragments due to the random nature of the bag (you do not know what you will get before you open it).<br/>
<br/>That said however, you could still opt to pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62383/wrap-of-the-great-turtle">
<img alt="Wrap of the Great Turtle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrap of the Great Turtle</span></a> while decidedly worse than above, it's still a highly competitive item (relative to BiS) and is simple to acquire, requiring only reputation.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Cloak Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74234/enchant-cloak-protection">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Protection</span></a></div>
