<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Chest for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70950/immolation-chestguard">
<img alt="Immolation Chestguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Chestguard</span></a> is by a fair margin the better option for you this phase, though the steep valor buy in makes it difficult to recommend. As time goes on, this is substantially less prohibitive and we don't recommend that this is your first purchase regardless of when you gear your <a class="icontiny c2" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=2/paladin">
<img alt="Paladin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_paladin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Paladin</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60354/reinforced-sapphirium-chestguard">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Chestguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Chestguard</span></a> sits as a good pick up. While part of a set, the bonuses are not outstanding for anyone looking to gear up, the 4-set is not really worthwhile chasing in a vacuum, consider holding off on this a bit and just picking it up for the stats.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Chest Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74251/enchant-chest-greater-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Greater Stamina</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74200/enchant-chest-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Stamina</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a></div>
