<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hardened Elementium Hauberk</span></a></td>
