<img alt="Blacksmithing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_blacksmithing.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blacksmithing</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Wrist for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65143/bracers-of-impossible-strength">
<img alt="Bracers of Impossible Strength" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Impossible Strength</span></a> are some highly competitive tanking wrists available to pick up for 50 Fragments. Since easy to come by wrists are in fairly short supply (they all require prohibitive costs or grinds), we recommend that this is your go-to pick up in all pre-raid cases.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70937/bracers-of-regal-force">
<img alt="Bracers of Regal Force" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raidwarrior_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Regal Force</span></a> are available to us as BoE VP item, meaning you could either pay for these using your own valor, or purchase them off someone else. A solid strategy, if you have multiple characters is to farm additional VP on an alt and purchase what you need on that character, thus reducing the overall burden on your <a class="icontiny c2" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=2/paladin">
<img alt="Paladin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_paladin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Paladin</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70121/rickets-gun-show">
<img alt="Ricket's Gun Show" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_53.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ricket's Gun Show</span></a> are available for purchase after doing a longs series of quests, while not <i>heavily</i> recommended, you ought to do your dailies associated with the Molten Front regardless. These take 25 days to unlock all in all, but they beat out the alternatives.<br/>
<br/>If neither of these are your fancy, your options are limited to dungeon drops primarily, best of luck though.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Wrist Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74229/enchant-bracer-superior-dodge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Superior Dodge</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=62256/enchant-bracer-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Major Stamina</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74239/enchant-bracer-greater-expertise">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Greater Expertise</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74232/enchant-bracer-precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Precision</span></a></div>
