<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Hands for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>Right out of the bat, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70949/immolation-handguards">
<img alt="Immolation Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Handguards</span></a> are pretty kick-ass, while the 2-set is accessible to you pre-raid, we don't necessarily recommend that you mindlessly rush this though. If you're getting this, at least initially you should do it for the stats first and foremost however there's another piece introduced to us in phase 3 that might interest you if you want to save time (and spend gold).<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69937/eternal-elementium-handguards">
<img alt="Eternal Elementium Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_raiddeathknight_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Elementium Handguards</span></a> are BoE crafted gloves that uses high end crafting materials and more importantly, Firelands exclusive materials. This means that while these can not be crafted without entering Firelands, you the user could purchase these off someone who has. These are likely to be fairly expensive early on and we won't assume that you have the inclination to drop the bank for these, though they offer very similar stats to tier this phase.<br/>
<br/>Finally, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60355/reinforced-sapphirium-handguards">
<img alt="Reinforced Sapphirium Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Sapphirium Handguards</span></a> are solid and relatively easy to obtain only setting you back time investment to grind out your JP. They have good stats and is a decent springboard to kick off from.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Glove Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82177/quickflip-deflection-plates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quickflip Deflection Plates</span></a> &amp; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74132/enchant-gloves-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Mastery</span></a></div>
