<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Legs for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>Akin to other potential valor pieces that you can pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70947/immolation-legguards">
<img alt="Immolation Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Legguards</span></a> in pre-raid, this is a solid item that matches up exceedingly well to prior pieces. Set bonus aside, this has ideal stats for you and we do think you should collect it with relative urgency.<br/>
<br/>While these are not strictly protection legs, we favor them over the alternatives for the most part. Otherwise if <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69583/legguards-of-the-unforgiving">
<img alt="Legguards of the Unforgiving" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of the Unforgiving</span></a> drop beforehand you should probably save your JP or spend it elsewhere.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Leg Enchants</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71720/drakehide-leg-armor">
<img alt="Drakehide Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cataclysmarmorkit_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drakehide Leg Armor</span></a>. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">Leatherworkers</a> can make their own <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=101600/drakehide-leg-reinforcements">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drakehide Leg Reinforcements</span></a>.</div>
