<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Feet for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60229/war-torn-crushers">
<img alt="War-Torn Crushers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">War-Torn Crushers</span></a> are available for 80 Fragments, while among the most expensive purchased catch-up items, we can recommend these to most users. Assuming you don't want to splurge a load of cash on BoEs, we think you should look to pick these up first.<br/>
<br/>Phase 3 adds <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69947/mirrored-boots">
<img alt="Mirrored Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_raiddeathknight_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mirrored Boots</span></a>, while BoE they are crafted and ""easy"" to get, they require Firelands material to craft and will likely be prohibitively costed early on. Get these, or don't we aren't inclined to make a recommendation.<br/>
<br/>The Twilight Highlands rep boots are a very nice go-to pair with built-in bad luck protection as you can target farm these. If you don't have the time or inclination to farm rep, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63444/baron-silverlaines-greaves">
<img alt="Baron Silverlaine's Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Baron Silverlaine's Greaves</span></a> are OK and will do their job.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Feet Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74238/enchant-boots-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Mastery</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74189/enchant-boots-earthen-vitality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Earthen Vitality</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74236/enchant-boots-precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Precision</span></a></div>
