<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Neck for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60227/caelestraszs-will">
<img alt="Caelestrasz's Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caelestrasz's Will</span></a> can be bought for 80 Fragments. We consider this to be a highly competitive item and will potentially beat out VP options. It's expensive but it also has a lot of longevity.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70935/stoneheart-necklace">
<img alt="Stoneheart Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_firelands_2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stoneheart Necklace</span></a> sits as a fairly outstanding neck as far as ctc is concerned, however we don't favor this ahead of many of the other VP/<wbr/>Fragment options, you can skip this for a while.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57932/the-lustrous-eye">
<img alt="The Lustrous Eye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lustrous Eye</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56319/carrier-wave-pendant">
<img alt="Carrier Wave Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carrier Wave Pendant</span></a> are tuned to effectively give you the exact same outcomes, you get the former if you have an abundance of JP and the latter if you, well just loot it.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67138/buc-zakai-choker">
<img alt="Buc-Zakai Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Buc-Zakai Choker</span></a> may be picked up here if you can get an outstanding bargain, you're trading miniscule amounts of %avoidance vs very sparse amounts of stamina.<div class="pad"></div>
