<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Trinkets for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>While <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68915/scales-of-life">
<img alt="Scales of Life" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_balanceofpower.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scales of Life</span></a> is a raid drop, being BoE you could obtain this before ever stepping your foot into a raid. The item itself is very potent without ever factoring in the heal, stamina trinkets are inherently solid all rounder picks for us throughout the expansion.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70143/moonwell-phial">
<img alt="Moonwell Phial" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_alchemy_imbuedvial.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moonwell Phial</span></a> is obtained from grinding out some Molten Front dailies, likewise a solid pick up as above though what matters more here is how eager you are to actually get it.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62466/mirror-of-broken-images">
<img alt="Mirror of Broken Images" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_platnumdisks.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mirror of Broken Images</span></a> is a bit of a niche item. While passive mastery is nice and all, generally speaking we'd prefer stamina here. With that said, the on-use effect is unparalleled versus resistable magic damage and is on a very generous CD.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65048/symbiotic-worm">
<img alt="Symbiotic Worm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qiraj_skinsandworm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Symbiotic Worm</span></a> suffers from the same issue as Mirror in that, it's fairly one-note though we do prefer passive stamina over passive mastery in dungeons and other pre-raid content. It costs 50 Fragments and while we think you should get this, don't rush it.<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c2" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
