<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Weapons for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>Added in phase 3 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70163/unbreakable-guardian">
<img alt="Unbreakable Guardian" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_cataclysm_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unbreakable Guardian</span></a> is actually reasonable in the amounts of materials necessary to make. Most players will be able to afford this, though recall that weapons are less important to us in Cataclysm than previous expansions.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59347/mace-of-acrid-death">
<img alt="Mace of Acrid Death" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_bwdraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace of Acrid Death</span></a> is purchased for 20 Fragments, while it's on the cheaper side we have a lot of options when it comes to weapon selection, you may want to hold off on buying this ahead of more important upgrades.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59521/soul-blade">
<img alt="Soul Blade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_grimbatolraid_d_01-.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Blade</span></a> is another raid drop (but BoE), from the last tier. As such we wanted to give it a mention because with us moving beyond tier 11, this could go for cheap and would be a solid pick up for anyone looking to take advantage.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74244/enchant-weapon-windwalk">
