<img alt="Shield of the Four Grey Towers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shield of the Four Grey Towers</span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
